rp:Transition a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One transition of an aggregate, as an activity: which aggregate it used, from which state to which, when, by whom and with which comment. The toolkit stores it as the activity of the commit that moves the aggregate, in the provenance graph, and keeps it when the aggregate is deleted. The payload slots belong to the command only: the stored record has none of them." ;
	rdfs:label "Transition" ;
	sh:closed true ;
